---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: "stdout(&w.run(\"worker\", &[\"brief\"]))"
---
inbox (2 unread)
  [hail ask from:boss id:[id] scope:auth] review the auth change
  [hail fyi from:boss id:[id]] status with a body
holds / blocks on me (1)
  [hail hold from:boss to:worker id:[id]] hold the merge (since [time], until [time])
open obligations on me (1)
  [hail ask from:boss id:[id] scope:auth] review the auth change — hail boss done --re [id] '<what was done>'
